sequenceDiagram
    actor W as Writer
    actor S as Specialist
    actor A as Admin
    participant API as Baho API
    participant WF as LessonWorkflow
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor L as Learner
    W->>API: POST /admin/content (lesson, quiz, photo, recording URL)
    API->>DB: save lesson, status "review"
    A->>API: PATCH /admin/content/:id/status (published)
    API->>WF: resolve("published", "review") on a topic with a specialist
    WF-->>API: "review" (held)
    API-->>A: 409 A specialist must approve this lesson first
    S->>API: GET /review/queue
    API-->>S: lessons in the specialist's diseases, with quiz answers
    S->>API: POST /review/lessons/:id (approve, note)
    API->>DB: status "approved", reviewed_by, reviewed_at
    A->>API: PATCH /admin/content/:id/status (published)
    API->>WF: resolve("published", "approved")
    WF-->>API: "published"
    API->>DB: status "published"
    L->>API: GET /content
    API-->>L: published lessons only
